# Money Invariants

- Use `ade_core::Money` (i64 micro-dollars) for all financial arithmetic.
- Never reintroduce `f64` for money math.
- Convert display/USD strings only at UI/CLI/API boundaries.
- Soft caps and ledgers must stay integer-safe under concurrent reserve/reconcile.
